				(object Attribute
				    tool       	"Java"
				    name       	"Abstract"
				    value      	TRUE))
			    quid       	"34B0F7A3011F"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Called when the applet wants to be resized. 
|     *
|     * @param   width    the new requested width for the applet.
|     * @param   height   the new requested height for the applet.
|     * @since   JDK1.0
|     
			    
