|     * <code>long</code> seed. 
|     *
|     * @param   seed   the initial seed.
|     * @see     java.util.Random#setSeed(long)
|     * @since   JDK1.0
|     
			    
			    parameters 	(list Parameters
				(object Parameter "seed"
				    type       	"long"))
			    concurrency 	"Sequential"
