			    quid       	"34B0F7EA01EB"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Reads a 64 bit double.
|     * @return the 64 bit double read.
|     * @exception EOFException If end of file is reached.
|     * @exception IOException If other I/O error has occurred.
|     * @since     JDK1.1
