			    quid       	"34B0F7E700B9"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Writes a <code>long</code> to the underlying output stream as eight
|     * bytes, high byte first. 
|     *
|     * @param      v   a <code>long</code> to be written.
|     * @exception  IOException  if an I/O error occurs.
