		    documentation 	
|
| * The data input interface is implemented by streams that can read 
| * primitive Java data types from a stream in a machine-independent 
| * manner. 
| *
| * @author  Frank Yellin
| * @version 1.8, 01/22/97
| * @see     java.io.DataInputStream 
| * @see     java.io.DataOutput  
