			(object Operation "write"
			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F7EF012F"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Write a portion of a string.
|     *
|     * @param  str  A String
|     * @param  off  Offset from which to start writing characters
|     * @param  len  Number of characters to write
|     *
