			    concurrency 	"Sequential"
			    opExportControl 	"Public"
			    uid        	0)
			(object Operation "connect"
			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F7EC026B"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Connects this piped input stream to a sender. 
|     *
