				(object Attribute
				    tool       	"Java"
				    name       	"Final"
				    value      	TRUE))
			    quid       	"34B0F81401E9"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Returns the parent of this thread group.
|     *
|     * @return  the parent of this thread group. The top-level thread group
|     *          is the only thread group whose parent is <code>null</code>.
|     * @since   JDK1.0
|     
			    
			    result     	"ThreadGroup"
