				(object Attribute
				    tool       	"Java"
				    name       	"Abstract"
				    value      	TRUE))
			    quid       	"34B0F80E00FC"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Gets the error stream of the subprocess.
|     * This stream is usually unbuffered.
|     *
|     * @return  the input stream connected to the error stream of the
|     *          subprocess.
