			(object Operation "SimpleDateFormat"
			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F866017A"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Construct a SimpleDateFormat using the given pattern and
|     * locale-specific symbol data.
|     
			    
