			    documentation 	
|
|     * recovers current pattern.
|     * @param withWhiteSpace puts spacing around the entries, and \n
|     * before & and <
|     
			    
			    parameters 	(list Parameters
				(object Parameter "withWhiteSpace"
				    type       	"boolean"))
			    result     	"String"
			    concurrency 	"Sequential"
			    opExportControl 	"Public"
			    uid        	0)
