		    quid       	"34B0F6D20262"
		    documentation 	
|
| * <P>When JDBC unexpectedly truncates a data value, it reports a
| * DataTruncation warning (on reads) or throws a DataTruncation exception
| * (on writes).
| *
| * <P>The SQLstate for a DataTruncation is "01004".
| 
		    
