			(object Operation "divide"
			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F81701ED"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Returns a BigInteger whose value is (this / val).  Throws an
|     * ArithmeticException if val == 0.
