			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F8170218"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Returns a BigInteger whose value is equivalent to this number
|     * with the designated bit cleared. (Computes (this & ~(1<<n)).)
|     * Throws an ArithmeticException if n < 0.
