		    documentation 	
|
| * <p>This class is a simple holder for a key pair (a public key and a
| * private key). It does not enforce any security, and, when initialized, 
| * should be treated like a PrivateKey.
| *
| * @see PublicKey
| * @see PrivateKey
| *
| * @version 1.3 97/08/30
| * @author Benjamin Renaud
| 
		    
		    operations 	(list Operations
			(object Operation "KeyPair"
			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F82E02B2"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Constructs a key with the specified public key and private key.
|     * 
|     * @param publicKey the public key.
|     * 
|     * @param privateKey the private key.
|     
			    
			    parameters 	(list Parameters
				(object Parameter "publicKey"
				    type       	"PublicKey")
				(object Parameter "privateKey"
				    type       	"PrivateKey"))
			    concurrency 	"Sequential"
			    opExportControl 	"Public"
			    uid        	0)
			(object Operation "getPublic"
			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F82E02B5"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Returns the public key from this key pair.
|     * 
|     * @return the public key.
|     
			    
			    result     	"PublicKey"
			    concurrency 	"Sequential"
			    opExportControl 	"Public"
			    uid        	0)
			(object Operation "getPrivate"
			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F82E02B6"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Returns the private key from this key pair.
