|     * @since     JDK1.0
|     
			    
			    concurrency 	"Sequential"
			    opExportControl 	"Public"
			    uid        	0)
			(object Operation "getSelectedCheckbox"
			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F7A80285"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Gets the current choice from this check box group.
