			    attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
			    quid       	"34B0F7B10179"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Gets the title of the dialog.
|     * @return    the title of this dialog window.
|     * @see       java.awt.Dialog#setTitle
|     * @since     JDK1.0
|     
			    
			    result     	"String"
