			    quid       	"34B0F7B800EB"
			    documentation 	
|
|     * Removes the specified component from this layout. 
|     * <p>
|     * Most applications do not call this method directly.  
|     * @param    comp   the component to be removed.
|     * @see      java.awt.Container#remove(java.awt.Component)
