		    documentation 	
|
| * EventQueue is a platform-independent class that queues events, both
| * from the underlying peer classes and from trusted application classes.
| * There is only one EventQueue for the system.
| *
| * @version 1.17 06/23/97
| * @author Thomas Ball
| 
		    
