|     * @see #setAnimated
|     * @see #setFullBufferUpdates
|     
				    
				    parameters 	(list Parameters
					(object Parameter "x"
					    type       	"int")
					(object Parameter "y"
					    type       	"int")
					(object Parameter "w"
