				    documentation 	
|
|     * Return the status of the pixels.  The ImageObserver flags
|     * representing the available pixel information are returned.
|     * @see ImageObserver
|     * @return the bitwise OR of all relevant ImageObserver flags
|     
				    
				    result     	"int"
