					    name       	"Static"
					    value      	TRUE))
				    quid       	"34B0F7C700D1"
				    documentation 	
|
|     * Returns a String describing the keyCode, such as "HOME", "F1" or "A".
|     * These strings can be localized by changing the awt.properties file.
|     
				    
